{"id":"81be88bd-ffa2-4c7c-b31b-a1118491ab0b","title":"Dot Panels 1","slug":"dot-panels-1","collectionSlug":"dot-panels","collectionName":"Dot Panels","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A deep space-themed shader effect featuring a starfield that gradually fades from left to right. The left side displays bright, scattered blue-white dots representing stars against a dark navy background, while the right side progressively darkens into near-complete black, creating a depth gradient effect. The background uses a radial gradient transitioning from a dark teal-blue (#001e2e) to an almost pure black (#05051a), centered slightly off-center toward the lower-left. A subtle grid structure underlies the composition with minimal visibility. The stars exhibit a twinkling animation effect with varying opacity, creating a sense of atmospheric depth and cosmic movement. A progressive blur filter is applied with center-weighted falloff, causing the stars to become increasingly diffuse and out-of-focus toward the right edge of the frame. The entire composition is overlaid with fine film grain at low intensity (0.02), adding subtle texture and a cinematic quality. The perspective is tilted slightly (15 degrees) with a wide field of view (96 degrees), creating a sense of immersion into the starfield. The overall mood is serene, mysterious, and contemplative, evoking the vastness of space.","colors":["#001e2e","#05051a","#80a8ff","#041b33"],"labels":[],"cover":"/shaders/covers/81be88bd-ffa2-4c7c-b31b-a1118491ab0b.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Perspective","id":"idmjt1is9eqaabag3il","_key":"key_mjt1is9b7sbm8t2m8","props":{"fov":96,"pan":-38,"tilt":15,"zoom":2.28,"edges":"mirror","center":{"x":0.4820846905537459,"y":0.9993658271425983},"offset":{"x":0.5846905537459284,"y":0.574651204928429},"opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation